      "excerpt": "iNucleus iNucleus is an AI native operating nucleus for knowledge systems, agent coordination, and IP evolution. Brand Role Primary language : English Track : AI native operations / knowledge systems / agent coordination Audience : founders, agent builders, knowledge system teams Operating idea : a compact core where knowledge, decisions, agents, and evolving IP assets stay aligned. Voice Precise, calm, systemic, and",
      "text": "# iNucleus\n\niNucleus is an AI-native operating nucleus for knowledge systems, agent coordination, and IP evolution.\n\n## Brand Role\n\n- **Primary language**: English\n- **Track**: AI-native operations / knowledge systems / agent coordination\n- **Audience**: founders, agent builders, knowledge system teams\n- **Operating idea**: a compact core where knowledge, decisions, agents, and evolving IP assets stay aligned.\n\n## Voice\n\nPrecise, calm, systemic, and high-signal. Use fewer words than expected, but keep the architecture visible.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\nDark core, electric clarity, and minimal structural rhythm. Use deep ink surfaces, blue signal lines, and restrained violet accents.\n",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"inucleus-guide-1-inucleus\">iNucleus</h1>\n<p>iNucleus is an AI-native operating nucleus for knowledge systems, agent coordination, and IP evolution.</p>\n<h2 id=\"inucleus-guide-1-brand-role\">Brand Role</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Primary language</strong>: English</li>\n<li><strong>Track</strong>: AI-native operations / knowledge systems / agent coordination</li>\n<li><strong>Audience</strong>: founders, agent builders, knowledge system teams</li>\n<li><strong>Operating idea</strong>: a compact core where knowledge, decisions, agents, and evolving IP assets stay aligned.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"inucleus-guide-1-voice\">Voice</h2>\n<p>Precise, calm, systemic, and high-signal. Use fewer words than expected, but keep the architecture visible.</p>\n<h2 id=\"inucleus-guide-1-visual-direction\">Visual Direction</h2>\n<p>Dark core, electric clarity, and minimal structural rhythm. Use deep ink surfaces, blue signal lines, and restrained violet accents.</p>\n"
    }
